// Axe moveset (WP-051). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Weapon classes": heavy
// chops, status-friendly, medium speed, 1.9 m reach, Might. Frame numbers are tuning unless
// a spec line says otherwise. Each chop carries Rupture buildup (the axe's status). Dodges
// (roll, backstep) are shared in common.ron; the critical pair is shared in crits.ron, and
// the weapon's crit_mult_percent (100) sets the crit.
// total_frames = startup + active + recovery; a hitbox window is (startup, startup + active - 1).
// Schema: crates/content/src/moves.rs.
